\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  Jesus good examples only
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 you taught us as children
\par when you acquired full knowledge
\par in your heav'nly father's home
\par and later went into your home
\par you obeyed your mum and father.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.  You had an immense knowledge
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 when you were very young
\par you read the words of the Bible
\par and questioned much about them
\par you detested all foolish things
\par and were mindful about good things.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  O Jesus let me reverence
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Your heav'nly father's house
\par and also honour my parents
\par and elders just like you
\par help me to work with all my might
\par \pard     be learned and become blessed too.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

